              "status": "accepted",
              "justification": "User-namespace remapping and rootless mode are not available in Docker Desktop without Enhanced Container Isolation (Business subscription). Compensating controls: every tenant runs as uid 10001 with all capabilities dropped, no-new-privileges and seccomp. (expires 2026-12-31, approved by project owner (pending review))"
            }
          ]
